{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36708","headline":"箧中得故王郎中书 · 罗隐","name":"箧中得故王郎中书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤里前年别望郎，丁宁唯恐滞吴乡。\n劝疎杯酒知妨事，乞与书题作裹粮。\n苹鹿未能移海曲，县花寻已落河阳。\n九原自此无因见，反覆遗踪泪万行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}